sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Liquidator
    participant UI as Frontend UI
    participant LP as LendingPool Contract
    participant O as Price Oracle
    participant DT as Debt Token (ERC20)
    participant CT as Collateral Token (ERC20)
    participant B as Borrower

    Note over L,B: 1. Phát hiện vị thế rủi ro
    UI->>LP: getAccountData(borrower)
    LP-->>UI: (collateral, debt, HF)
    UI->>UI: Check HF < 1
    UI-->>L: Hiển thị danh sách liquidatable

    Note over L,B: 2. Liquidator chọn và cấu hình
    L->>UI: Chọn borrower, debt asset, collateral asset
    L->>UI: Nhập repay amount
    UI->>LP: getCurrentDebtBalance(borrower, debtAsset)
    LP-->>UI: debtAmount
    UI->>LP: reserves(debtAsset)
    LP-->>UI: closeFactorBps
    UI->>UI: Tính maxRepay = debt × closeFactor%
    UI->>O: getAssetPrice1e18(debtAsset)
    O-->>UI: priceDebt
    UI->>O: getAssetPrice1e18(collateralAsset)
    O-->>UI: priceColl
    UI->>UI: Tính seizeUSD = repayUSD × (1 + bonus%)
    UI->>UI: Tính seizeTokens = seizeUSD / priceColl
    UI-->>L: Hiển thị ước tính seize amount

    Note over L,B: 3. Validation và Approve
    UI->>LP: getAccountData(borrower)
    LP-->>UI: HF (kiểm tra < 1)
    UI->>DT: balanceOf(liquidator)
    DT-->>UI: balance
    UI->>DT: allowance(liquidator, LendingPool)
    DT-->>UI: allowance
    
    alt Allowance không đủ
        UI-->>L: Hiển thị nút "Approve"
        L->>UI: Nhấn "Approve"
        UI->>DT: approve(LendingPool, MaxUint256)
        DT-->>UI: Transaction hash
        UI->>UI: Chờ confirm
        DT-->>UI: Transaction confirmed
    end

    Note over L,B: 4. Gửi giao dịch thanh lý
    L->>UI: Nhấn "Xác nhận"
    UI->>LP: liquidationCall(debtAsset, collateralAsset, borrower, repayAmount)
    
    Note over LP: 5. Contract validation
    LP->>LP: _accrue(debtAsset)
    LP->>LP: _accrue(collateralAsset)
    LP->>LP: _getAccountData(borrower)
    LP->>LP: Check HF < 1
    LP->>LP: _currentDebt(borrower, debtAsset)
    LP->>LP: Apply close factor
    LP->>LP: Clamp repay amount
    
    Note over LP,DT: 6. Transfer debt asset
    LP->>DT: safeTransferFrom(liquidator, pool, repayAmount)
    DT->>DT: Transfer tokens
    DT-->>LP: Success
    
    Note over LP,O: 7. Tính toán seize
    LP->>O: getAssetPrice1e18(debtAsset)
    O-->>LP: priceDebt
    LP->>O: getAssetPrice1e18(collateralAsset)
    O-->>LP: priceColl
    LP->>LP: Tính repayUSD = repay × priceDebt
    LP->>LP: Tính seizeUSD = repayUSD × (1 + bonus%)
    LP->>LP: Tính seizeTokens = seizeUSD / priceColl
    LP->>LP: Check userCollNow >= seizeTokens
    LP->>LP: Check poolCash >= seizeTokens
    
    Note over LP,B: 8. Cập nhật vị thế borrower
    LP->>LP: debtNew = debtNow - repay
    LP->>LP: collNew = collNow - seize
    LP->>LP: Update userReserves[borrower]
    
    Note over LP: 9. Cập nhật reserve
    LP->>LP: debtReserve.cash += repay
    LP->>LP: debtReserve.totalDebt -= repay
    LP->>LP: collReserve.cash -= seize
    
    Note over LP,CT: 10. Transfer collateral
    LP->>CT: safeTransfer(liquidator, seizeTokens)
    CT->>CT: Transfer tokens
    CT-->>LP: Success
    CT-->>L: Liquidator nhận collateral
    
    Note over LP: 11. Emit event
    LP->>LP: Emit Liquidated(liquidator, borrower, ...)
    
    LP-->>UI: Transaction success
    UI-->>L: Hiển thị thành công







